<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Nov 26.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Nov 26.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flights may be postponed at airports in Russia's Northern Caucasus, mid-Volga region and the southern Urals on November 27 due to thick fog in the morning, the Russian Weather Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
